# Paths the Tauri dev file-watcher must ignore.
#
# During `tauri dev` the app's working directory is src-tauri/, so it writes its
# runtime data here: config JSON, the wallet store, per-task files, logs, and
# rankings. Without this list, every settings save / wallet add / balance
# refresh / log line is seen by the watcher as a source change and triggers a
# rebuild + window restart. Ignoring them means dev only restarts on real code
# edits.
settings/
wallet/
task/
logs/
rankings/
*.tmp
